	"description":"Born from the lawless asteroid belts and salvage fields of Breh'Inni, the Junk Pirates are a loose feudal confederation of scrappers, privateers, and eccentric outer-fringe nobility answering to the King on Glory. Their fleets are welded together from civilian hulls, industrial machinery, and experimental scavenged technology, relying on heavy armor, high-energy salvos, and volatile Plug-Jet engine overclocks to overwhelm their foes in brutal close-range brawls.",
